<p>Dear <%= @event.user.username %>,</p>

<p>We are pleased to inform you that your event titled <strong><%= @event.title %></strong> has been successfully published on the SciLifeLab Training Portal.</p>

<p>Event Details:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Event Title:</strong> <%= @event.title %></li>
  <li><strong>URL:</strong> <%= event_url(@event) %></li>
  <li><strong>Start Date:</strong> <%= @event.start_date.strftime('%d %B %Y') %></li>
  <li><strong>End Date:</strong> <%= @event.end_date.strftime('%d %B %Y') %></li>
  <li><strong>Location:</strong> <%= @event.location.presence || 'Online' %></li>
</ul>

<p>You can view and manage your event using the link below:</p>
<%= link_to 'View Event', event_url(@event), style: 'display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; background-color: #045C64; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;' %>

<p>We appreciate your contribution and look forward to seeing your event on our platform.</p>

<p>Thank you for being a part of our community!</p>

<p>Best regards,</p>
<p>The SciLifeLab Training Portal Team</p>